  "entry": "code/README.md",
  "notes": "Found in a public repository and run by a computer-use agent (batch public-1). Compare a gene's curated RefSeq transcript variants (or transcripts you paste), decide whether a chosen variant can be amplified on its own (unique exon, exon–exon junction only, or infeasible), and design and QC-check primers for it, or design one pair that amplifies all variants for total expression. Data used in the run: example. tree.json is the workflow the agent did and a second agent replayed; run.json says how.",
